  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Tenu: Change Silvallié dans sa forme Ténèbres.  Change le type de Coup Varia-Type en Ténèbres.",
      "short_effect": "Tenu: Change Silvallié dans sa forme Ténèbres.  Change le type de Coup Varia-Type en Ténèbres.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Held: Changes Silvally to its Dark form.  Changes Multi-Attack’s type to Dark.",
      "short_effect": "Held: Changes Silvally to its Dark form.  Changes Multi-Attack’s type to Dark.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "あくタイプの　データが　はいった\nメモリ。　とくていの　ポケモンが\nもつと　タイプが　かわる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "악타입의 데이터가 들어 있는\n메모리. 특정 포켓몬이\n지니면 타입이 바뀐다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "裝有惡屬性資料的記憶碟。\n特定寶可夢攜帶後，\n就會產生屬性的變化。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une carte mémoire contenant des données sur\nle type Ténèbres. Un certain Pokémon peut changer\nde type en l’équipant.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Disc mit Daten zum Typ Unlicht.\nSie löst bei einem bestimmten Pokémon\neinen Typenwechsel aus.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Disco de datos que contiene información relativa\nal tipo Siniestro. Permite cambiar de tipo a cierto\nPokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ROM contenente dati sul tipo Buio in formato\ndigitale. Permette a un certo Pokémon di cambiare\ntipo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A memory disc that contains Dark-type data.\nIt changes the type of the holder if held by\na certain species of Pokémon.",
